    <abstract>

<t>This document addresses two omissions in the Secure Frame (SFrame) protocol
specification.  First, the definition of the IANA "SFrame
Cipher Suites" registry in RFC 9605 omits several important fields.  This document updates the IANA
registry by adding those fields and
defining the contents of those fields for current entries.
Second, the Authenticated Encryption with Associated Data (AEAD) construction based on AES-CTR and HMAC is defined only for
the 128-bit security level.  This document registers parallel constructions
at the 256-bit security level.</t>
    </abstract>
